<h2>About This Guide</h2>

This guide was researched, written, and maintained by <a href="https://libertybelljerseys.com" target="_blank">Liberty Bell Jerseys</a>. It exists because determining whether an NHL jersey is legitimate can be genuinely difficult, and there was no single comprehensive interactive resource to help people do that.

This is a living document. If you spot something wrong, outdated, or missing, contributions are welcome.

<small>Brand logos are used solely to identify manufacturers and are the property of their respective owners. This guide is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Adidas, Fanatics, Reebok, CCM, Koho, or Starter.</small>

