For fringe cases or a second opinion, check the <a href="https://reddit.com/r/hockeyjerseys/about/sticky" target="_blank">r/hockeyjerseys monthly legit check thread</a> or join the <a href="https://discord.com/invite/hockeyjerseys" target="_blank">Hockey Jerseys Discord</a>.

<h3>Privacy</h3>

This guide collects no personal data. There are no analytics, no tracking scripts, no cookies, and no forms. Your session state (which step you're on) is stored only in the URL hash in your browser — nothing is sent anywhere.

This site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may collect standard server-side access logs (IP address, browser, timestamp) as part of routine web hosting — see <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank">GitHub's Privacy Statement</a> for details.

